Lewica declares that the night meeting was a search for another majority before
publishing a name or a number. Our factions enjoy the clear line; Poland 2050
closes ranks around Hołownia and PSL asks whether it can still share a list with
a partner accused of preparing its betrayal.

- @poland_event_queue: File the public accusation

@night_minutes
