- @poland_event_queue: File the post-split investigation

@night_open_channels
title: Treat cross-party dialogue as legitimate unless votes move
subtitle: Judge the successor parties by written terms and votes, even if proof arrives late.
view-if: third_way_split = 1
on-arrival: third_way_night_meeting_response = "Open dialogue with a recorded-votes red line"; p2050_relation += 2; psl_relation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 1; public_trust += 1; news_headline = "Lewica judges the separate centrist parties by votes rather than visitors"

We state that former allies may speak to PiS and will be judged when their
votes, written terms or offices move. Poland 2050 and PSL both welcome the rule.
Lewica accepts the risk that the first conclusive evidence may arrive only when
the parliamentary bargain is already mature.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the votes-not-visitors rule

@night_split_accuse
title: Accuse Poland 2050 of shopping for a PiS majority
subtitle: Force a public loyalty test and accept that Poland 2050 may treat Lewica as the provocateur.
