Lewica accuses Hołownia's party of shopping for a PiS majority. Poland 2050's
ministers and deputies must deny the charge individually, turning a private
meeting into a public loyalty test. Our camp unites while the centre acquires a
reason to treat us as the actor trying to force its split.

- @poland_event_queue: File the realignment charge

