Lewica presents the indictment as the trial of the entire radical right.
Progressive supporters hear moral clarity; Mentzen is invited to defend conduct
from a rival organisation, while Braun can describe every count as evidence
that an electoral front has ordered the court to remove him.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the political front

