= A failed vote remains failed

**[+ formation_2025_candidate +]** did not win the required absolute majority.
The candidate is not installed by narrative fiat. The outgoing cabinet remains
in caretaker office. The President's first attempt is now exhausted, so
initiative passes directly to the Sejm for the second Article 154 attempt.

